ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 646 Tm
(LSM means Linux Security Modules.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 621 Tm
(It is the kernel security framework that lets Linux call security checks at important) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 606 Tm
(operations such as opening files, executing programs, or creating network connections.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
1 0 0 1 54 581 Tm
